<h3>Welcome to the new VALD!</h3>

<p>This website is the new interface to VALD. We hope everything feels familiar, but
please note that</p>

<p>
<ul>
<li>You do not need to register anew, but you do need to set a password. Enter your registered
 email address in the login form and we will send you a one-time activation link, which lets you
 set the password for future logins.</li>
<li>Your unit preferences and custom line-list configuation have been imported from the old system.</li>
<li>Under "My Requests" you can now see the status and links to your earlier queries. The "modify"-link allows to re-submit a query anew.</li>
<li>Requests are now handled immediately and in parallel, so results should appear quicker. Some queries can however still take minutes to finish.</li>
<li>The data and extraction methods are unchanged, you get the same results as from the old site.</li>
<li>Additional linelist configurations allow to more easily include predicted lines, or exclude molecules.</li>
<li>The site now chooses light or dark layout according to your system preferences.</li>
</ul>
</p>
<p>
For feedback and bug-reports, please feel free to <a href="doc/contact.html">contact us</a>.
</p>

